   "desc": "Analytics.Club Chicago: Data & AI Community, Connect. Grow. Are you a PhD student, postdoc, faculty member, or research professional looking to grow your academic network, find job opportunities, or explore potential collaborations? **ResearchersConnect** is your new go-to **virtual research networking event**, designed to bring together minds from across disciplines, institutions, and geographies. Hosted on a Slack-like platform, this **online community for researchers** offers a space for idea exchange, knowledge sharing, and career development. Whether you're seeking a new role, scouting research collaborators, or learning about the latest **research funding and grants**, this platform empowers you to connect meaningfully — all from the comfort of your home or office. 🎥 **Watch the explainer video to see how to make the most of your experience:** 👉 [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K0PaumQ9Rj8](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K0PaumQ9Rj8) **💬 What You Can Expect:** Join us in a flexible and engaging **academic career fair online**, where participants have access to multiple themed channels and direct 1-1 video or text conversations. Here’s how the space is organized to help you thrive: * **General** – Your welcome lounge for intros, announcements, and community-wide discussions. Great for getting oriented and starting conversations. * **Intros** – Share your academic background, research focus, or current project. Connect with like-minded individuals. * **Networking** – Post your portfolio, recent publications, or research goals. Explore interdisciplinary connections and brainstorm with fellow attendees. * **Help Wanted** – Looking for a co-author, lab partner, or someone with statistical expertise? Post your ask or offer help here. * **Research Funding & Grants** – Exchange tips, resources, and experiences around securing research funding, writing proposals, or navigating fellowship applications. * **Collaboration Corner** – Meet potential partners for cross-disciplinary research and innovative joint ventures. * **Industry Room: Research & Academia** – Stay up to date on trends, methodologies, and tools shaping the future of research in academia and industry. You’ll be able to: * Chat live with fellow attendees across the globe * Join topic-specific channels tailored to your goals * Conduct **1-on-1 video chats** with researchers, hiring professionals, and peers * Share resources, publications, and job openings with the community * Explore a vibrant **research collaboration platform** that fosters real-world impact **📍 Location:** All sessions take place virtually at 👉 [https://events.tao.ai/pod/analytics.club/6wmav4fgzzha](https://events.tao.ai/pod/analytics.club/6wmav4fgzzha) **🌍 Who Should Join?** * Graduate students and postdocs seeking their next academic or industry role * Professors and principal investigators open to new projects or interdisciplinary connections * Research professionals and employers scouting talent or collaborators * Grant writers and administrators looking for strategic partnerships * Anyone involved in **academic research, scientific collaboration, or proposal development** **🕓 When:** The event runs from **4:00 PM – 6:00 PM local time** in your region. Visit the event link above for details and access. **💡 Have Questions or Suggestions?** We’d love to hear from you! Drop us a note here: 👉 [https://noworkerleftbehind.org/event_support](https://noworkerleftbehind.org/event_support) **📢 Join the movement and amplify your research journey with:** #ResearchersConnect #VirtualResearchNetworking #AcademicCareerFairOnline #ResearchCollaborationPlatform #OnlineCommunityForResearchers #ResearchFundingAndGrants #PhDNetworking #PostdocCareer #ResearchJobs #InterdisciplinaryResearch #GlobalResearchEvent #NetworkingForAcademics",
